==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**10 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A simple [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] stage that you've probably dealt with before. The difference is the introduction of the new enemy, Doctor K.O.!! Unfortunately for them, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] just wins against this glorified [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] Shadow Boxer K.

Bringing [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] with its Immune to Surge [[Talents]] help well to combat Doctor K.O, while [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] works as a support to be used when the doctor comes nearby. Any ranged Surge-immune attackers should be enough to deal with the main threats overall. Good examples are Talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]], [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]], and [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]]. Remember to bring [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] for the Fallen Bear. If you happen to own [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]], which you really should as this is post-[[Sage of Mind Soractes|Soractes]], he simplifies this stage even more.

Talented [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Bellydance Cat]] is another effective yet costly meatshield here, as every enemy except for Squire Rel is either Red or Aku.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune ubers]] like [[Lucifer the Fallen (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Lucifer]] and [[Talents|Ultra Talented]] [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Akuma Hayabusa]] are great examples who also outrange every enemy on the stage, allowing them to melt it with little difficulty. [[Furiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Ragelan Pasalan]] also works here for these reasons, with his Strengthen and Survive Talents making him a great generalist nuker as well.

